# Keep line endings the same on every computer. A shell script or Containerfile checked out with
# Windows line endings (CRLF) fails inside a Linux container. Clone inside WSL when you can; these
# attributes keep the scripts working if someone clones on the Windows side anyway.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
Containerfile text eol=lf

# Images are not text.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
